WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Act 1.

2
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.560
Birling has just told the young men that
each man should look after himself and

3
00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.790
his family.

4
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.880
Then the doorbell rings.

5
00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:14.080
A man in a dark coat walks in, and
the cosy light turns hard and bright.

6
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.090
He takes them one at a time.

7
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.720
A photograph, shown to
one person, then the next.

8
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.090
He seems to know the answers already.

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.050
Policeman?

10
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:23.930
Ghost?

11
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.040
Conscience?

12
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:28.350
Who, or what, is Inspector Goole?

13
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.950
In this mission, you'll study
how Priestley stages his arrival,

14
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.380
down to the lighting.

15
00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.480
You'll watch how he controls the evening,

16
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.980
deciding who leaves and who stays.

17
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.770
And you'll weigh three very
different readings of who he is.

18
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.440
Your mission: decide who,
or what, Inspector Goole is.
